Jennifer Lopez famously sings, &#x201C;Don&#x2019;t be fooled by the rocks that I got, I&#x2019;m still, I&#x2019;m still Jenny from the block.&#x201D;

She certainly had a lot of rock at the Thursday night premiere of her concert film &#x201C; The JLo Show .&#x201D;

Lopez was not only wearing a Chantilly lace gown and a satin shawl-coat from Dolce & Gabbana, but she accessorized with jewels from the Italian fashion house, including the 186-carat diamond Sicilia necklace. The massive centerpiece yellow pear-shaped diamond alone is 110 carats. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories 'Hold Onto Me' Director Myrsini Aristidou Kicks Off Historic Oscar Campaign for Sundance Audience Award Winner: 'I Really Feel Like We're Underdogs'

JLo first noticed the ensemble and the jewelry when she performed at Dolce & Gabbana&#x2019;s Alta Moda fashion show in Taormina, Italy, in July. &#x201C;While I was there, I saw this necklace and I saw this coat and I said, &#x2018;I love those,&#x2019;&#x201D; Lopez, who is styled by Rob Zangardi and Mariel Haenn, told me on the red carpet. &#x201C;He said, &#x2018;I&#x2019;m going to send them to you for your premiere.&#x2019; He gifted me the coat and he sent the necklace for tonight.&#x201D;

The necklace was said to require a four-person security detail, including two armed off-duty police officers. &#x201C;There&#x2019;s security all around just watching the necklace,&#x201D; Lopez said.

It doesn&#x2019;t sound like Lopez was looking to buy the stunning piece. &#x201C;This is a very expensive necklace,&#x201D; she said, laughing. &#x201C;It&#x2019;s gorgeous. It&#x2019;s beautiful. Whoever does wind up owning it will be very lucky. It&#x2019;s an heirloom piece for sure.&#x201D;

&#x201C;The JLo Show&#x201D; features Lopez in concert in Las Vegas. She performs her greatest hits while chronicling her life from being a little girl growing up in the Bronx to becoming the superstar she is today. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

&#x201C;I&#x2019;m working on my next album, making a lot of music right now and just enjoying life right now,&#x201D; Lopez said. &#x201C;In a lot of ways, this show is an important show I think in my career and that it marks a certain moment in my life. It puts a button, a period, an exclamation, two exclamation points on everything I&#x2019;ve done till now. Now we can tell a new story.&#x201D;

&#x201C;We can be a new person,&#x201D; she continued. &#x201C;We can go into a different part of our life that is somewhat kind of scary because I&#x2019;m on my own. My kids have gone to college and I&#x2019;m single and all of that, but it is also super exciting and I&#x2019;ve never felt kind of better and in my own power like I talk about in the show. It&#x2019;s a really good feeling and it&#x2019;s a really good place to be and I&#x2019;m very excited for people to experience this show &#x2026; I think it will be very entertaining but also inspiring and empowering.&#x201D;

Lopez&#x2019;s two children &#x2014; twins Emme and Max with ex-husband Marc Anthony &#x2014; are in their first year of college. &#x201C;Every time I walk into the house, and you can feel it,&#x201D; the singer and actress said of being an empty nester. &#x201C;You can feel it. But I know that it&#x2019;s their home and their rooms are exactly [the same], I don&#x2019;t close the doors. The doors are open. I walk by. I see their stuff. I walk in there sometimes.&#x201D;

She admits that she cries &#x201C;all the time.&#x201D;

&#x201C;They are such a part of you,&#x201D; Lopez said. &#x201C;My twins, they&#x2019;re everything and they both went at the same time. But they call a lot, we FaceTime a lot. Thank God. It&#x2019;s a transition for them too and they realize they go away, and they go, &#x2018;Oh, I do need Mom&#x2019; and that&#x2019;s a good feeling. It has its bonuses, too.&#x201D;

In an earlier interview , Lopez told me she doesn&#x2019;t mind being single and isn&#x2019;t looking for romance at the moment. &#x201C;I don&#x2019;t need to date,&#x201D; she said. &#x201C;I&#x2019;m good right now. I&#x2019;m happy. I&#x2019;m not trying to fuck it up.&#x201D;

After four marriages that ended in divorce and numerous boyfriends, Lopez said, &#x201C;I&#x2019;ve learned a lot over the past 20 years, but also the past couple of years have really been about becoming more self-aware and really understanding what love is. I had a real idea about love as a little girl and moving through this crazy life that I found myself in, I realized that what I thought love was really isn&#x2019;t love.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-articleX-uid2' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["btf","mid-articleX","mid"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-articleX") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[620,366]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

