Said Richardson: &#x201C;Zaire and I founded Ivy Lion to serve as a 360 vehicle for content development and production in an ever-evolving media landscape, and we are thrilled for this new chapter with The Gotham Group as we scale our footprint on screen and hunker down on our exciting partnerships with the next generation of authors, screenwriters, and playwrights.&#x201D;

